  "body": "Design record for #6054 (Atlas Cluster 6, follow-up 33), written per the scoped follow-on from triage task 10420 (task 13761, queue repo-health-code-pilot). doc/2026-11-09T00-42-59Z_design_atlas_deletion_propagation.md decides only the four questions triage left open: (a) detection per source class on sync (generation manifest diff; edit = version not deletion; minimised = suppressed_at_source; two-step confirmation before purge), (b) external-corpus purge semantics (text + vectors + indexes, no restore; distinct from retention retirement), (c) the trace-log tombstone for #6027 (ids + content hash + audit chain, no content), (d) the per-zone policy switch (versioned policy-layer function over license-capture provenance: own zone keeps own-authored deleted items retained-but-unserved; third-party and external zones purge). Sibling rulings reused by reference (retention §4.4/§5.2, license-capture §2/§5); defaults interim pending parent #6024's D.6 conclusion. Design only; implementation split in §8 of the record.\n\nCloses #6054\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796777184&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7883&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7883&signature=7d6df3969bfdd950f344beb8345579a4be35d663a8d2396d6194afa11ee83a0c\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7883?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmi